1
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,407
Grandpa!

2
00:01:41,962 --> 00:01:45,500
I got thirty red circles! 
I got a whole thirty circles!

3
00:01:46,199 --> 00:01:51,556
Oh? Let me see. Hmm, thirty circles, huh?

4
00:01:53,029 --> 00:01:54,460
You did great!

5
00:01:55,129 --> 00:01:56,340
I did it!

6
00:02:00,509 --> 00:02:02,880
Mokku, you've really become a good boy.

7
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:09,118
It's true! I became a good boy. Next, 
I'm going to be an honor student!

8
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:24,280
Are you that happy?

9
00:02:24,575 --> 00:02:25,649
The teacher told us...

10
00:02:25,673 --> 00:02:28,663
...that having good grades isn't 
enough to make you an honor student.

11
00:02:29,269 --> 00:02:32,475
You also have to help out properly at home.

12
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:36,187
Huh? You don't get it, Grandpa.

13
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,320
Huh?

14
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:41,680
Well, Mokku has really 
changed. Good for him.

15
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:44,940
W-What the...!

16
00:02:47,170 --> 00:02:49,120
Mokku, wh-what are you doing?!

17
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:53,049
I learned in school that 
mice are filthy animals.

18
00:02:53,458 --> 00:02:54,698
What did you say?!

19
00:02:55,610 --> 00:03:02,159
Mice are bad animals that ravage crops
and food, and even carry infectious germs.

20
00:03:02,765 --> 00:03:05,412
How dare you say that! That's sewer rats!

21
00:03:05,530 --> 00:03:07,360
I'm a respectable field mouse!

22
00:03:07,540 --> 00:03:09,316
Stop it, stop it, stop it! Cut it out!

23
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:12,252
But Redbeard, you've never washed 
your hands or face, have you?

24
00:03:12,509 --> 00:03:14,127
You really are filthy.

25
00:03:15,724 --> 00:03:17,799
Damn you! Take this!

26
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:27,638
Did you forget that I'm 
an oak puppet, Redbeard?

27
00:03:31,675 --> 00:03:33,930
What, you got picked on?

28
00:03:34,087 --> 00:03:35,400
Yes, exactly.

29
00:03:38,410 --> 00:03:39,720
Well, take a seat.

30
00:03:40,348 --> 00:03:41,175
Yes.

31
00:03:42,090 --> 00:03:47,646
This isn't just about me. It concerns 
you too, Boss Kenken, and Hanaguro.

32
00:03:47,670 --> 00:03:48,986
Concerns us, too?

33
00:03:49,239 --> 00:03:50,146
Yes...

34
00:03:50,256 --> 00:03:53,451
That Mokku has the nerve 
to say animals are filthy.

35
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:56,980
And he told me to go 
live with Boss Kenken...

36
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:01,440
This is a matter of honor for all animals.

37
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:05,856
Exactly! Just because Mokku's 
been acting like a good boy lately...

38
00:04:05,881 --> 00:04:08,980
...he's looking down on us animals.

39
00:04:09,214 --> 00:04:11,100
- It makes me sick!
- Unforgivable!

40
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,282
Right?

41
00:04:12,306 --> 00:04:15,389
Even today, just because he got a perfect 
score in art class for the first time...

42
00:04:15,413 --> 00:04:19,039
...he's getting cocky and saying 
he'll become an honor student.

43
00:04:19,905 --> 00:04:21,500
Now that pisses me off even more.

44
00:04:21,655 --> 00:04:25,060
You've got to take a
stand here, Boss Kenken.

45
00:04:25,525 --> 00:04:29,914
All right! Animals of the world, rise up!

46
00:04:30,063 --> 00:04:31,640
Yeah!

47
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:49,902
That's the third time!

48
00:04:50,105 --> 00:04:52,016
Damned fish, I've had it with you!

49
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:53,802
All right, this time for sure!

50
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:02,181
Oh, hello there, Mokku.

51
00:05:02,225 --> 00:05:03,120
What do you want?

52
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,840
Oh, nothing. You were fishing
here yesterday, too, weren't you?

53
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,727
Yeah.

54
00:05:07,930 --> 00:05:09,078
How are they biting today?

55
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,216
Not a thing.

56
00:05:10,427 --> 00:05:13,348
You were here the day before 
yesterday, too, right? How was it then?

57
00:05:13,704 --> 00:05:15,056
No luck at all.

58
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:17,422
Oh, really?

59
00:05:18,020 --> 00:05:22,900
Huh, not a single one? But 
why come out here every day?

60
00:05:23,470 --> 00:05:25,700
Because I'm a good boy now!

61
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:28,600
That's right. Good for
you, Mokku. Keep it up.

62
00:05:28,950 --> 00:05:30,484
Mokku, what's wrong?

63
00:05:31,105 --> 00:05:32,480
It's nothing.

64
00:05:33,585 --> 00:05:36,968
I wanted to catch lots of fish 
for Grandpa to eat, but...

65
00:05:37,155 --> 00:05:39,798
...I'm not very good at fishing.

66
00:05:40,012 --> 00:05:42,875
Is that so? That makes me happy.

67
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:47,681
I had no idea my pal Mokku was 
so attached to his Grandpa.

68
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:51,184
Hey, please. Let me help you out.

69
00:05:51,805 --> 00:05:55,307
I've got it! I know a 
place packed with fish.

70
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:57,200
You're not bad at fishing, Mokku.

71
00:05:57,375 --> 00:06:00,395
You just don't know where they are.

72
00:06:00,537 --> 00:06:04,240
But Kenken, we were never really friends...

73
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:08,925
That's because I didn't 
know what a kind kid you were!

74
00:06:09,066 --> 00:06:13,669
Forgive me for before. From 
today on, I'm your best friend!

75
00:06:14,076 --> 00:06:16,620
Do you really know a
place with lots of fish?

76
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:23,056
Of course I do! Let me show you the way. I
am truly touched by your kind heart, Mokku.

77
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:24,720
All right, I'm counting on you.

78
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:27,251
Good, good. Come on,
let's go, let's go, let's go.

79
00:06:29,730 --> 00:06:32,620
You can't go, Mokku. You mustn't go!

80
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,373
Aren't I your best friend?!

81
00:06:37,694 --> 00:06:39,490
If something terrible happens
to you, don't come crying to me.

82
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:55,895
Not yet?

83
00:06:56,063 --> 00:06:57,929
Not yet. I wonder why.

84
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,575
Are we gonna get there soon?

85
00:07:00,599 --> 00:07:02,680
No need to be in such a rush.

86
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:13,100
Tied up tight.

87
00:07:18,010 --> 00:07:23,700
Still, Mokku's a good kid,
catching fish for his grandfather.

88
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:27,160
I'll get along with all of you, too.

89
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:30,340
And I'm going to be a model student, too!

90
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:34,229
Now, catch a whole bunch right here.

91
00:07:34,485 --> 00:07:36,980
The bottom of the lake is full of fish.

92
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:48,720
Today, I'm going to give
Grandfather plenty of fish to eat!

93
00:07:53,890 --> 00:07:56,400
Oh no! The boat is sinking!

94
00:07:58,710 --> 00:08:00,420
Mokku! Jump!

95
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,760
Boss!

96
00:08:02,179 --> 00:08:03,179
We did it!

97
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,055
Boss!

98
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:32,120
It went well, didn't it?

99
00:08:32,222 --> 00:08:33,419
No doubt about it!

100
00:08:33,444 --> 00:08:34,503
Listen to this!

101
00:08:39,569 --> 00:08:43,195
Heh, now the old man is yours forever.

102
00:08:43,465 --> 00:08:47,020
That's what happens when a mere
puppet tries to become a model student.

103
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,040
Yeah, it's a sweet deal.

104
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:52,616
You'd better keep bringing
me tons of my favorite food...

105
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:55,078
...all the good stuff! I wonder why.

106
00:08:55,149 --> 00:08:59,230
I understand completely.
Well then, I'll be going...

107
00:09:00,743 --> 00:09:02,102
Excuse me!

108
00:09:02,188 --> 00:09:02,884
Fool.

109
00:09:04,795 --> 00:09:08,893
Now we can milk him for
all he's worth. I'm so happy.

110
00:09:09,185 --> 00:09:12,065
Forget that, let's wait
and see a little longer.

111
00:09:12,445 --> 00:09:15,240
He's got the devil's own luck, after all.

112
00:09:15,285 --> 00:09:22,640
Yep. That's the great thing about you,
Boss. Always so cautious. I wonder why.

113
00:09:22,672 --> 00:09:23,860
Heh-heh.

114
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:55,452
Is Mokku done for at last? Guess
he couldn't float back up after all.

115
00:10:25,727 --> 00:10:27,753
Mokku, goodbye...

116
00:10:32,602 --> 00:10:33,506
Mokku!

117
00:10:33,530 --> 00:10:34,530
Cricket!

118
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:41,000
Mokku, thank goodness! I'm so glad!

119
00:10:41,239 --> 00:10:44,771
My leg... I left one of my
legs at the bottom of the lake.

120
00:10:45,385 --> 00:10:46,385
Your leg?

121
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:48,320
Yeah. I'm going to get it back.

122
00:10:49,229 --> 00:10:50,426
Ah, wait, wait!

123
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,947
Oh, Mokku, you idiot!

124
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,635
You just barely survived!

125
00:10:55,659 --> 00:10:58,671
Throwing your life away over
a leg is completely pointless!

126
00:10:58,870 --> 00:11:00,965
Idiot! Idiot! Big idiot!

127
00:11:27,238 --> 00:11:28,499
Look, he's back!

128
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:30,266
I can stand again!

129
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,120
Oh no, run!

130
00:11:32,305 --> 00:11:33,780
Yeah, that's it! Run, run!

131
00:11:45,749 --> 00:11:47,460
Mokku! What happened?!

132
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:51,759
Grandpa!

133
00:11:56,969 --> 00:12:00,060
Mokku! Stay right there!
Stay right where you are!

134
00:12:07,589 --> 00:12:10,480
Mokku! What on earth happened?!

135
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:13,624
Grandpa!

136
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:16,380
There, there. It's all
right now, it's all right.

137
00:12:16,485 --> 00:12:17,695
Grandpa!

138
00:12:34,219 --> 00:12:35,600
Grandpa, I'm heading out!

139
00:12:35,915 --> 00:12:40,220
Right, be careful on your way.
How is your leg holding up, eh?

140
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:44,020
Much better than before! Look, see?

141
00:12:46,109 --> 00:12:49,080
Hey, stop that! You'll break
it again if you're so reckless!

142
00:12:49,849 --> 00:12:53,120
I'll be fine! Grandpa's
the best in the world!

143
00:12:56,301 --> 00:12:57,077
Mokku!

144
00:13:00,940 --> 00:13:01,940
Huh?

145
00:13:04,449 --> 00:13:07,800
Grandpa, help! I can't walk like this!

146
00:13:07,975 --> 00:13:10,780
I told you not to be so reckless!

147
00:13:11,845 --> 00:13:12,845
Hold still...

148
00:13:19,899 --> 00:13:21,216
There, that should do it.

149
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:24,300
Don't go hanging around with Kenken
and Hanaguro anymore, you hear?

150
00:13:24,749 --> 00:13:27,101
I know. I'm off!

151
00:13:30,359 --> 00:13:32,340
Study hard, now!

152
00:13:33,409 --> 00:13:34,860
Leave it to me!

153
00:13:46,745 --> 00:13:50,095
Well, well, Mokku. Aren't you devout?

154
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:53,920
Oh, it's just you, No-ra. I
have to get to school. See ya.

155
00:13:55,580 --> 00:13:57,347
Wait, wait, Mokku.

156
00:13:57,652 --> 00:14:00,034
You have a chance to become a real
human, and you're just throwing it away?

157
00:14:00,059 --> 00:14:01,520
Foolish Mokku.

158
00:14:01,725 --> 00:14:04,160
Liar! You've got to be lying!

159
00:14:04,345 --> 00:14:07,739
God would punish me if I
told a lie in front of a church.

160
00:14:07,855 --> 00:14:09,382
I'm still going to school.

161
00:14:10,924 --> 00:14:15,934
Hey, Mokku. If you want to become a
real human, you should enter a monastery.

162
00:14:17,859 --> 00:14:19,460
Just like a priest.

163
00:14:20,299 --> 00:14:21,299
A priest?

164
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:26,080
That's right. Even priests have to
enter a monastery to become one.

165
00:14:31,259 --> 00:14:35,478
If you train at a monastery too, Mokku,
you'll surely become a real human.

166
00:14:36,739 --> 00:14:39,313
If you head south past
two mountains from here...

167
00:14:39,337 --> 00:14:41,220
...there's a Camaldolese monastery.

168
00:14:41,321 --> 00:14:43,980
I hear the abbot is a very kind man.

169
00:14:56,279 --> 00:14:58,720
Thank you, No-ra. I'll go check it out!

170
00:15:07,599 --> 00:15:12,505
You're so good at this. A
true genius. I wonder why?

171
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:17,443
The honor of all animals is riding
on this plan. Thank you, No-ra.

172
00:15:17,989 --> 00:15:22,043
I don't care about thanks.
Deceiving people is just my hobby.

173
00:15:22,645 --> 00:15:24,340
You better hurry or you
won't make it in time.

174
00:15:24,939 --> 00:15:27,466
Oh, right! Lets go Hanaguro!

175
00:15:27,593 --> 00:15:32,224
Roger that! We can't fail
this time. I wonder why?

176
00:15:32,421 --> 00:15:35,874
Boss! Boss! Wait
up, wait up, wait up!

177
00:15:59,257 --> 00:16:01,058
Welcome, Mokku.

178
00:16:02,785 --> 00:16:05,486
Why? How do you know my name?

179
00:16:06,139 --> 00:16:09,960
God sees all. Even your wish.

180
00:16:10,195 --> 00:16:12,140
However, the training will be severe.

181
00:16:12,365 --> 00:16:16,180
If it means becoming a real
human, I'll endure any hardship.

182
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:21,560
That's a good attitude. God
will surely grant you a miracle.

183
00:16:43,714 --> 00:16:45,850
This is severe ascetic penance.

184
00:16:45,874 --> 00:16:49,467
If you obey God without
food or water for three days...

185
00:16:49,491 --> 00:16:52,738
...your wish will be granted in an instant.

186
00:16:53,275 --> 00:16:56,320
I'm a wooden puppet, so going
without food is no problem for me.

187
00:16:56,629 --> 00:16:57,945
Oh, good boy.

188
00:17:02,999 --> 00:17:05,160
It feels like becoming divine, doesn't it?

189
00:17:05,559 --> 00:17:09,060
Indeed. Blessed are those who believe.

190
00:17:12,129 --> 00:17:14,720
I'll be back in three days without fail.

191
00:17:15,074 --> 00:17:16,780
Yes, I'll be fine.

192
00:17:17,469 --> 00:17:21,200
Ah, now I can finally become a real human.

193
00:17:39,333 --> 00:17:43,157
That Mokku will dry up and die...

194
00:17:43,806 --> 00:17:45,761
...completely unaware it's
the end of the line for him...

195
00:17:45,785 --> 00:17:49,280
...yet he still thinks he can become
human. What a fool. I wonder why.

196
00:17:51,471 --> 00:17:52,647
<i>Come on, God...</i>

197
00:17:53,429 --> 00:17:56,780
<i>No matter how hard
it gets, I will endure it.</i>

198
00:18:11,301 --> 00:18:13,604
Water... water...

199
00:18:13,628 --> 00:18:19,820
I need water... I'm a wooden puppet, I
can't survive without it... Water, water...

200
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:23,580
Mokku, there's nothing I can do!

201
00:18:23,901 --> 00:18:24,771
Water...

202
00:18:32,947 --> 00:18:34,060
Mokku...

203
00:18:34,339 --> 00:18:36,020
Hang in there!

204
00:18:36,043 --> 00:18:37,063
Mokku...

205
00:18:45,639 --> 00:18:48,860
Oak Tree Fairy, please help me!

206
00:18:49,094 --> 00:18:50,094
Water...

207
00:18:51,239 --> 00:18:53,931
I do not have that power right now.

208
00:18:54,709 --> 00:19:01,261
But if this keeps up, I'm going to
die! I don't want to die! Please, no!

209
00:19:01,662 --> 00:19:03,828
Becoming a real human...

210
00:19:03,852 --> 00:19:07,726
...is not something you achieve by
clinging to God or relying on others.

211
00:19:08,414 --> 00:19:10,420
You must carve out your own
path with your own strength.

212
00:19:10,739 --> 00:19:15,914
I don't want a lecture! Hurry
and bring me water! Water!

213
00:19:16,619 --> 00:19:21,820
You have placed yourself in God's hands.
All you can do now is await His will.

214
00:19:23,797 --> 00:19:25,413
Ah, wait!

215
00:19:25,919 --> 00:19:29,295
You must reap what you sow.

216
00:19:42,139 --> 00:19:43,760
I don't want to die...

217
00:20:01,180 --> 00:20:03,020
Rain! It's raining!

218
00:20:16,309 --> 00:20:19,541
Just how damn lucky can this brat get?

219
00:20:20,619 --> 00:20:24,160
He was supposed to be completely
dried up and dead by now.

220
00:20:26,239 --> 00:20:31,260
Watching him suffer slowly just
makes it more fun for us anyway.

221
00:20:31,701 --> 00:20:33,120
I wonder why.

222
00:20:35,069 --> 00:20:37,202
Because he's not getting
away from us either way, yes.

223
00:20:37,319 --> 00:20:38,580
That's right.

224
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:53,800
Ah, help!

225
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,598
Help me!

226
00:21:00,596 --> 00:21:01,405
That Mokku brat...

227
00:21:01,429 --> 00:21:04,167
...won't die of exposure—this time
he's gonna drown with the water rising!

228
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:05,020
I wonder why.

229
00:21:05,130 --> 00:21:06,020
Quiet!

230
00:21:07,263 --> 00:21:08,460
Serves him right!

231
00:21:13,729 --> 00:21:15,260
Don't worry! Let's get out of here!

232
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,213
Okay!

233
00:21:33,519 --> 00:21:35,570
Grandpa!

234
00:21:39,374 --> 00:21:42,532
You do care about me! You
came to save me, didn't you?!

235
00:21:45,774 --> 00:21:48,605
Hurry and cut this rope with
those proud fangs of yours!

236
00:22:14,089 --> 00:22:16,500
All right, Redbeard, this way next.

237
00:22:17,225 --> 00:22:20,420
Damn it, why is this rope so tough?!

238
00:22:29,609 --> 00:22:31,620
All right, Redbeard, climb onto my head.

239
00:22:32,204 --> 00:22:34,280
Hold on tight so you don't fall off.

240
00:22:57,409 --> 00:23:00,360
I'm sorry. You're a fine mouse, Redbeard.

241
00:23:03,869 --> 00:23:05,348
Here you go, Redbeard!

242
00:23:05,959 --> 00:23:07,980
You saved my life.

243
00:23:17,249 --> 00:23:19,333
It's not like I wanted to save you.

244
00:23:22,749 --> 00:23:25,600
From now on, I'm going to
be good friends with Redbeard!

245
00:23:33,309 --> 00:23:35,889
<i>Mokku goes to town with Grandfather...</i>

246
00:23:35,913 --> 00:23:38,818
<i>...but even there, everyone makes
fun of him, calling him a puppet...</i>

247
00:23:38,842 --> 00:23:41,001
<i>...and he can't help feeling heartbroken.</i>

248
00:23:41,663 --> 00:23:44,561
<i>However, Melleri, the only
daughter of a wealthy family...</i>

249
00:23:44,585 --> 00:23:48,412
<i>...makes the dressed-up Mokku her
playmate, unaware that he is a puppet.</i>

250
00:23:49,436 --> 00:23:51,608
<i>Mokku soon falls in love with Mellerie...</i>

251
00:23:51,632 --> 00:23:55,320
<i>...and desperate not to be hated, hides
the fact that he is a wooden puppet...</i>

252
00:23:55,321 --> 00:23:57,709
<i>...and he just can't bring
himself to tell her the truth.</i>

253
00:23:57,975 --> 00:24:00,640
<i>Look forward to next week's 
Kashi no Ki Mokku!</i>

